description	"Shin Hati

A pursuing Force User with a mixed fighting style.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Cripples/Tracks/Force Focuses
- Lightsaber (Purple/Cyan/Yellow Style)
-- BP Free Jumps
-- Blaster Deflect (2)
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (2)
-- Saber Throw (1) ^3[CS1]
-- Tracks On Hit

^5Powers:
- Jump (3) 
- Sense (3) 
- Push (3)
- Pull (2)

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (2)
- Tracking Beacon
- Knockdown Roll
- Dexterity (3)
- Stamina (1)
- Anti MT (1)
- Healing Capped at 35
- Force Focus (3)
- Slow Faller 
- Sense Immunity
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Aerial Force Regen

^8Abilities:
- Sprint (1) ^3[CS2]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS4]"